BT /F1 28 Tf 60 505 Td (1. The basic circuit) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 455 Td (The simplest circuit is a battery, some connecting wire and a resistor) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 431 Td (in a loop. The battery creates a potential difference \(voltage\) that) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 407 Td (pushes electrons through the wire. Current flows out of the positive) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 383 Td (terminal, through the resistor, and back to the battery. MARKER-) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 359 Td (CIRCUIT-P1.) Tj ET
