BT /F1 28 Tf 60 505 Td (2. The water-hose analogy) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 455 Td (Think of a garden water hose. Battery voltage is the water-supply) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 431 Td (pressure: higher pressure pushes harder. The outlet valve is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 407 Td (resistor: closing it reduces the flow. The water flow itself is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 383 Td (electric current. Increase resistance and flow drops; open the valve) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 359 Td (\(less resistance\) and flow rises. MARKER-HOSE-P2.) Tj ET
endstream
