BT /F1 28 Tf 60 505 Td (3. Ohm's law and the triangle) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 455 Td (Ohm's law links the three quantities: V = I x R. Draw it as a triangle) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 431 Td (with V on top and I, R below. Cover the value you want: cover V and) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 407 Td (you read I multiplied by R; cover I and you read V divided by R; cover) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 383 Td (R and you read V divided by I. MARKER-TRIANGLE-P3.) Tj ET
endstream
