BT /F1 28 Tf 60 505 Td (4. Units and symbols) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 455 Td (In engineering voltage is denoted V and measured in volts. Resistance) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 431 Td (is denoted R \(or the omega sign\) and measured in ohms. Current is) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 407 Td (denoted I and measured in amps. So V=IR reads volts = amps x ohms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 383 Td (MARKER-UNITS-P4.) Tj ET
endstream
