BT /F1 28 Tf 60 505 Td (5. Worked example: 12V across 250 ohms) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 455 Td (Take a 12 volt battery with a 250 ohm resistor across it. Cover I in) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 431 Td (the triangle: I = V / R. 12 volts divided by 250 ohms gives 0.048) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 407 Td (amps, which is 48 milliamps - all without using a meter. Connecting) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 383 Td (wire has a small resistance too, but here the total is treated as 250) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 359 Td (ohms. MARKER-EXAMPLE-P5.) Tj ET
endstream
