BT /F1 28 Tf 60 505 Td (6. Series, parallel and the board practical) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 455 Td (An ammeter joins the loop in series so the full current passes through) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 431 Td (it. A voltmeter connects in parallel across the resistor only: red) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 407 Td (\(positive\) where current enters, black \(negative\) where it leaves. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 383 Td (rheostat in series varies the current for the experiment. Red) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 359 Td (terminals are positive, black are negative, and every connection must) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 60 335 Td (be tight. MARKER-PRACTICAL-P6.) Tj ET
endstream
